    "detailed_description": "This is a multi-person co-created online painting game, by the members of the word relay painting, to complete a number of complete paintings together, quickly call on friends to draw your story!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Painting in 3d scene: </h2><br>Paint in 3d scenes, intertwine fantasy with reality with a paintbrush, and more scenes await you to explore.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Special brush: </h2><br>With a special brush, you can paint a wider variety of pictures, perhaps with more variety.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Work with others: </h2><br>Multiple people work together, you can continue to create on other people's paintings, and complete a story together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Create your own brush: </h2><br>You can easily customize your brush, and your own brush may be more convenient to use.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Collect flowers: </h2><br>You can give flowers to others in multiplayer, or receive flowers from others as proof of recognition.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Create your own artwork: </h2><br>Create your own portfolio and paint to your heart's content.",
